Z||000003||1FST2M6||01-25-2000||12:39 PM||||If you can't get them from FOCOA, the ignition company Taylor a long with Magnecore and Vitek have 8mm wire and will gladly make you a set. I've got Red Magnecore with Blue sheilded boots from MSD. Available from Summit Racing, American Parts Warehouse (Atlanta, Ga.) and Jegs performance catalog. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||WKDFIRO||01-25-2000||01:50 PM||||Taylor wires are the one that you cut to length so you can really set it up clean the way you would like the wires to be. I have them on my V6. Love em!||||reg||14
